{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53478","headline":"送李愿归盘谷歌 · 韩愈","name":"送李愿归盘谷歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"盘之中，维子之宫；盘之土，维子之稼；盘之泉，可濯可沿；盘之阻，谁争子所！窈而深，廓其有容；缭而曲，如往而复。\n嗟盘之乐兮乐且无央，虎豹远迹兮蛟龙遁藏，鬼神守护兮呵禁不祥，饮且食兮寿而康，无不足兮奚所望！膏吾车兮秣吾马，从子於盘兮终吾生以徜徉！（《四部丛刊》影元刻本《朱文公校昌黎先生集》卷十九《送李愿归盘谷序》附此歌）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53478.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53478","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}